[tb_eval  exp="f.LeccaLeccaCuore-=1"  name="LeccaLeccaCuore"  cmd="-="  op="t"  val="1"  val_2="undefined"  ]
[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="CHERRY/Cherry_08_33.jpg"  ]
[tb_show_message_window  ]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==0"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
Cosa????[p]
Un lecca lecca speciale tutto per me?[p]
Davvero?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua>0 && f.Lingua!=3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
What????[p]
A special lollipop just for me?[p]
Really?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
Что????[p]
Особенный леденец только для меня?[p]
Правда?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_hide_message_window  ]
[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="CHERRY/Cherry_08_32.jpg"  ]
[tb_show_message_window  ]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==0"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
Beh...[p]
In questo caso credo che dovrò rischiare la rabbia della professoressa Olimpia![p]
E venire nel tuo ufficio per passare qualche momento segreto li![p]
#ZACK
(OMFG!!! Sto rischiando davvero troppo!)[p]
(Ma ormai non posso più tornare indietro!)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua>0 && f.Lingua!=3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
Well...[p]
In that case I guess I'll have to risk the wrath of Professor Olympia![p]
And come to your office to spend a few secret moments there![p]
#ZACK
(OMFG!!! I'm really risking too much!)[p]
(But I can't go back now!).[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
Ну...[p]
В таком случае, пожалуй, придётся рискнуть и навлечь на себя гнев профессора Олимпии![p]
И прийти к вам в кабинет, чтобы провести там несколько тайных минут![p]
#ZACK
(О БОЖЕ!!! Я действительно слишком сильно рискую!)[p]
(Но теперь уже не отступить!).[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_hide_message_window  ]
[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="CHERRY/Cherry_08_35.jpg"  ]
[tb_show_message_window  ]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==0"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
D'accordo...[p]
Andiamo nel mio ufficio...[p]
Ma mi raccomando...[p]
Non facciamoci vedere...[p]
Questo deve essere il nostro piccolo segreto![p]
#CHERRY
Ok, Zack...[p]
Ma solo se mi prometti che me lo farai succhiare!!![p]
EH EH EH!!![p]
#ZACK
(Merda... Non riesco a capire se questa ragazza sta giocando con me un gioco piccante e pericoloso...)[p]
(O se è solo molto ingenua, e non capisce i doppi sensi che dice!!)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua>0 && f.Lingua!=3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
All right...[p]
Let's go to my office...[p]
But make sure...[p]
Let's not be seen...[p]
This has to be our little secret![p]
#CHERRY
Okay, Zack...[p]
But only if you promise to let me suck it!!![p]
EH EH EH!!![p]
#ZACK
(Shit... I can't tell if this girl is playing a spicy and dangerous game with me...)[p]
(Or if she's just very naive, and doesn't understand the puns she's saying!!!)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
Ладно...[p]
Пойдём в мой кабинет...[p]
Но смотри...[p]
Постарайся, чтобы нас никто не увидел...[p]
Это должен быть наш маленький секрет![p]
#CHERRY
Хорошо, Зак...[p]
Но только если пообещаешь дать мне его пососать!!![p]
ХЕ-ХЕ-ХЕ!!![p]
#ZACK
(Чёрт... Не могу понять, играет ли эта девушка со мной в опасную и пикантную игру...)[p]
(Или она просто очень наивна и не понимает двусмысленности собственных слов!!!)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_hide_message_window  ]
[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="CHERRY/Cherry_08_36.jpg"  ]
[l  ]
[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="CHERRY/Cherry_08_37.jpg"  ]
[tb_show_message_window  ]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==0"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
Allora, Zack...[p]
Posso avere il mio lecca lecca ora?[p]
Sono così emozionata...[p]
Il mio cuore batte forte dentro il mio petto...[p]
Come mi piacerebbe fartelo sentire![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua>0 && f.Lingua!=3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
So, Zack.[p]
Can I have my lollipop now?[p]
I'm so excited...[p]
My heart is beating fast inside my chest....[p]
How I'd love to make you feel it![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
Ну что, Зак.[p]
Теперь можно получить мой леденец?[p]
Я так взволнована...[p]
Сердце быстро бьётся у меня в груди...[p]
Как бы мне хотелось, чтобы ты это почувствовал![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_hide_message_window  ]
[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="CHERRY/Cherry_08_38.jpg"  ]
[tb_show_message_window  ]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==0"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
OH MIO DIO!!![p]
E' bellissimo!!![p]
E sembra così succoso!!!![p]
Davvero posso mangiarlo, Zack?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua>0 && f.Lingua!=3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
OH MY GOD!!![p]
It's beautiful!!![p]
And it looks so juicy!!!![p]
Can I really eat this, Zack?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
О БОЖЕ!!![p]
Он прекрасен!!![p]
И выглядит таким сочным!!!![p]
Я правда могу это съесть, Зак?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_hide_message_window  ]
[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="CHERRY/Cherry_08_39.jpg"  ]
[l  ]
[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="CHERRY/Cherry_08_40.jpg"  ]
[tb_show_message_window  ]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==0"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
Grazie mille, Zack![p]
Sei davvero adorabile!!![p]
Dovrei proprio trovare il modo di ricambiare la tua gentilezza!!![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua>0 && f.Lingua!=3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
Thank you so much, Zack![p]
You are so lovely!!![p]
I really should find a way to reciprocate your kindness!!![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#CHERRY
Огромное спасибо, Зак![p]
Ты такой замечательный!!![p]
Мне действительно нужно найти способ отплатить тебе за доброту!!![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

